{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226920","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226920","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1422692001:1":{"text":"もう、再生することはないな……？","source_cn":"她不会再重生了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BBB79A58FCFE30A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1422692001":{"text":"もう、再生することはないな……？","source_cn":"她不会再重生了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BBB79A58FCFE30A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422692002:1":{"text":"ええ。明月樹と鹿霊から、喜びの感情が伝わってきます……","source_cn":"嗯，我能感到皎月树的气息，还有鹿灵，那样喜悦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE94782D3C9DEB330","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422692004:1":{"text":"鹿霊が、過去をすべて伝えてくれました。","source_cn":"鹿灵……已经将所有的过去传达给我了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB2A6D668D7C4933","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422692005:1":{"text":"当時、ミサタ様は厳しい選択を迫られていました。カタストロフに寄生されたフォレストエッグを完全に浄化することはできない――","source_cn":"当年……弥萨忒面临着两难抉择——恶魔已经寄生于翡绿之卵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D4BC446F74CF76B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422692006:1":{"text":"しかし、汚染された部分を切り取るということは、自らの力をも切り離すことになる……","source_cn":"而一旦剥离被污染的部分，也意味着要分离祂的神力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87F24F15898BB1F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422692007:1":{"text":"そこでミサタ様はこの空間を作り、シーダの本体をここに縛り付けて、明月樹の力で少しずつ浄化できないかと考えました。","source_cn":"于是，弥萨忒创造了这一空间，将恶魔悉达的本体镇压于此，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7347C02ECA301F81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422692008:1":{"text":"そして切り取った部分は、織り葉と共に、私たちの先祖とサロクディアへ移ったのだな……","source_cn":"而另一部分……则随着织叶和我的先祖们前往了萨洛克兰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30BBA7DF3831A381","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422692009:1":{"text":"確かに厄介なカタストロフだった。ミサタが怒るのも当然だな……","source_cn":"这样棘手的恶魔，难怪弥萨忒如此震怒……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A61FB48CEC66E6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422692010:1":{"text":"おそらく、ミサタ様はカタストロフを二つに分けて封じることで、奴を弱らせ、あるいは無力化しようと考えたのじゃろう。","source_cn":"弥萨忒可能认为，将恶魔分割成两部分，分别镇压，会使其力...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16A0262441E1FE65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1422692011:1":{"text":"まさか分裂した状態でも力を回復できるとは、思いもしなかったじゃろうな。","source_cn":"但祂没料到这恶魔即使分裂，也能在两地缓慢恢复力量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFF7DD4DB0D322A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1422692012:1":{"text":"ほかに選択肢がなかったのでしょう。カタストロフがフォレストエッグと完全に融合していれば、バドーゾ全域が滅んでいたかもしれません。","source_cn":"弥萨忒当时别无选择。如果恶魔彻底融入翡绿之卵，整个瓦度...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF903B96073C27A45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1422692013:1":{"text":"たとえ重い代償を払うことになろうとも、分断が唯一の方法だったのです。","source_cn":"分离是唯一的选择，尽管代价沉重。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF22CA8D122C0AE18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1422692014:0":{"text":"ミサタ様はもう一つ失念しておったようじゃな……寄生者は、宿主の意志に影響を与える。","source_cn":"弥萨忒还忽略了一件事——寄生者能够悄无声息地影响宿主的意志。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FF15198040AC2CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1422692015:0":{"text":"シーダの暗示と呪いの両方に、エクシルたちは心を蝕まれてしまったのじゃ。","source_cn":"恶魔悉达的暗示，以及诅咒的惩罚，让艾塞勒们迷失了心智。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DA16C4E050446C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_st